  "description": "Drop-in ASP.NET Core middleware that improves Core Web Vitals without touching your app code: critical CSS inlining, LCP preload, lazy loading, and on-demand WebP/AVIF transcoding on every HTML response. The C++23 PageSpeed engine runs in-process via P/Invoke. Single-package install with transitive native binaries for linux-x64, linux-arm64, osx-arm64, and win-x64.",
